  "prefLabel": "Bal 104.02 Custodian of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bal 104.02 Custodian of Records. The secretary of state shall be the custodian of the commission's records and shall respond to requests to examine those records which are subject to public inspection.\n\nSource. #6262, eff 6-7-96",
